          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#demo">观看 45 秒演示 ↓</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-meta reveal" style="--d:.28s">Mac Beta · macOS 11+ · Apple 芯片</p>
        <div class="tag-row reveal" style="--d:.32s">
          <span class="tag">引用回到原文段落</span>
          <span class="tag">分析可复算</span>
          <span class="tag">缺证据不编造</span>
          <span class="tag">GeneCode 分子克隆</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="glass panel reveal" id="hero-panel" style="--d:.2s" aria-label="示意：BioSeeki 如何处理一个科研问题">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <span class="panel-title">研究会话 · 示意</span>
          <span class="badge-live"><span class="live-dot"></span>深度研究</span>
        </div>
